y we're talking about civilization 6 the Civ games are definitely difficult games to at least initially give like a formal review on seeing how thes...  |  \n|  === Hey everyone, it's Luke here from LT Gaming and welcome back to the channel. All right, strategy fans, here's a big one. Civilization 6 is going free on the Epic Game Store this week. Not just the base game, the platinum edition with all the expansions, leader packs, and extra modes included. And if you've n...  |  \n|  === welcome back to a brand new civ 6 or civilization 6 video hope you're all having fantastic days but in the history of humankind mistakes have constantly been made take a look at my existence for example in this civ 6 video we're going to be talking about 5 early game mistakes that you need to stop making or ...  |  \n|  === hello everyone in this video I'll be trying to conquer the world and then nuke it because I'm playing as Gandhi the peaceful new Lord in Civics deity difficulty on a huge true start location Earth map with all 62 civilizations on it so this is India it's uh it's glorious but also the tiles are really bad And...  |  \n|  === hey guys my name is James and welcome to my channel now I know this video might be a bit different from my usual historical content but with civilization sticks coming out for free on the epic game store I managed to get a bunch of friends to try out the game and they all have been enjoying it quite a bit an...  |  \n|  === Food and production are undoubtedly the two most essential yields in any game of Civ 6. Regardless of your leader, regardless of your spawn, and regardless of your win condition, because without these two essential yields, you don't even have an empire to begin with. Both of their functions are pretty basic....  |  \n|  === every game in the legendary 25-year-old civilization 4X strategy series puts a new spin on the enormous concept of taking a nation from a single nomadic tribe to a world dominating superpower one turn at a time in that way civilization 6 looks familiar but it's loaded with some very smart and bold improvemen...  |  \n|  === civilization 6 is one of the most iconic games ever made and while it has great mechanics and amazing visuals there are core issues and things that you must know before you buy it but civilization 6 is a turn-based strategy game where you must build and expand your own Empire from the ground up but this is n...  |  \n|  === Всем привет и добро пожаловать на канал у микрофона панчи у большинство игроков которые наткнуться на это видео может появиться вопрос Зачем делать руководство по цивилизации 6 когда игра осталась в прошлом так как вышла цивилизация 7 потому что каждая следующая номерная часть когда выходила всегда была оче...  |  \n|  === After covering Civ 5 and Civ 7, the comment section has been very clear about what comes next. And yes, I hear you. I too have opinions about Civ 6 that I've been sitting on. So, here's what we're going to do. I am going to spend this video talking about Civ 6 without mentioning any other Civ games. And if I...  |  \n|  === in this video I'll be trying to win the game from this horrible start my capital is trapped by volcanoes in the middle of the ocean we're playing as Byzantium because of their unique unit no not a tagma the other one the ship that fires Greek Fire let's settle and start this game by building a monument techn...  |  \n|  === civilization six's first ten turns are crucial in this video i'm going to teach you how to master them i'm playing as the hungarian empire in a randomly generated world but that doesn't matter these tips that you can see on screen are universally applied let's begin the most logical place to start of course ...  |  \n|  === this is Hammer Robi he gets the full technology after securing a Eureka but this wasn't enough for him you see he wanted more and wanted to test the limits of his skills by flying planes in the Stone Age this was the predicament facing the man who was chosen to lead the Babylonian people in one of the worst ...  |  \nEnd of preview. Expand in Data Studio⟨41⟩\n* * *\n  *  Previous⟨29⟩\n  * 1⟨42⟩\n  * 2⟨43⟩\n  * 3⟨44⟩\n  * ...⟨45⟩\n  * 8⟨46⟩\n  * Next ⟨43⟩\n\n\nREADME.md exists but content is empty. \nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    126\nNumber of rows: 731 Total file size: 26.4 MB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨47⟩ Privacy⟨48⟩ About⟨49⟩ Careers⟨50⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
